.omc/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
logs/
wandb/

# --- run artifacts -----------------------------------------------------------
# Raw trajectory dumps: 91 MB across 103 runs and growing with every experiment, and every one is
# regenerable by re-running the command recorded in its metrics JSON. The JSON itself IS committed
# -- it is the measurement record CLAUDE.md cites by filename, and it is 412 KB. Local npz files
# are untouched, so rescore_trajectories.py / replay_wall_frame_ekf.py keep working.
results/*.npz
results/videos/
# Written by play.py on every startup as a "did the checkpoint really load" smoke check.
checkpoints/exported/
# Intermediate training checkpoints. Only policy_final.pt is ever referenced.
checkpoints/**/policy_[0-9]*.pt
